ta-orig="Growing Environment and Key Production Areas">Growing Environment and Key Production Areas</span></a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Price_Fluctuations_and_Market_Trend_2023%E2%80%932024" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_3" data-source="" data-orig="Price Fluctuations and Market Trend">Price Fluctuations and Market Trend</span> (2023–2024年)</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Why_Choose_Us_Direct_Sourcing_from_the_Main_Production_Area" >私たちを選ぶ理由: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_4" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area">Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area</span></a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92" >オオアザミのバルク製品を詳しく見る →</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#References_APA_Style" >参考文献 (アパスタイル)</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="114" data-end="168"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Milk_Thistle_Seed_Best_Price_Direct_from_Farms_in_Hebei"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_5" data-source="" data-orig="Milk Thistle Seed Best Price Direct from Farms in Hebei">Milk Thistle Seed Best Price Direct from Farms in Hebei</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>5月現在 2025, の価格 <a href="/ja/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">オオアザミの種子</a> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_6" data-source="" data-orig="has declined from RMB 14/kg in">has declined from RMB 14/kg in</span> 2024 12/kgになります. 一部の農場では、さらに低い引用を提供しています. これはほぼに変換されます <strong data-start="174" data-end="190">$1.66 米ドル/kg</strong> そして <strong data-start="195" data-end="211">€1.53 ユーロ/kg</strong>, 最近の為替レートに基づいています.</p><h2 class="" data-start="114" data-end="168"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Milk_Thistle_Global_Cultivation_History_and_Development_in_China"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_7" data-source="" data-orig="Milk Thistle Global Cultivation History and Development in China">Milk Thistle Global Cultivation History and Development in China</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157">アザミミルク (<em data-start="184" data-end="202">シリバム・マリアナム</em>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_8" data-source="" data-orig="originates from Europe and North Africa and has been used medicinally in Western countries for over">originates from Europe and North Africa and has been used medicinally in Western countries for over</span> 2,000 年 (サンら。, 2022). 中国では, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_9" data-source="" data-orig="it was first introduced as an ornamental plant from the UK by the Beijing Botanical Garden in">it was first introduced as an ornamental plant from the UK by the Beijing Botanical Garden in</span> 1952.</p><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157">その後 1972, 天津輸入 &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_10" data-source="" data-orig="Export Company introduced it from Germany for medicinal cultivation">Export Company introduced it from Germany for medicinal cultivation</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_11" data-source="" data-orig="China Chamber of Commerce of Medicines">China Chamber of Commerce of Medicines</span> &amp; 健康製品 [CCCMHPIE], 2020). 盤錦市初の試験栽培, 遼寧省, に始まった 1978. 今日, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_12" data-source="" data-orig="Panjin has become China&#8217;s largest milk thistle processing and extract export base">Panjin has become China&#8217;s largest milk thistle processing and extract export base</span> (曹氏ら。, 2023).</p><p class="" data-start="170" data-end="1157">1980 年代と 1990 年代までに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_13" data-source="" data-orig="its cultivation expanded rapidly across northeastern China">its cultivation expanded rapidly across northeastern China</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_14" data-source="" data-orig="with Liaoning and Heilongjiang provinces together accounting for over">with Liaoning and Heilongjiang provinces together accounting for over</span> 70% 国内生産高の (王, 2021; CCCMHPIE, 2020). この植物は正式に <em data-start="1052" data-end="1075">中国薬局方</em> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_15" data-source="" data-orig="and is now a common ingredient in many liver health supplements">and is now a common ingredient in many liver health supplements</span> (CCCMHPIE, 2020).</p><h2 class="" data-start="1159" data-end="1206"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Growing_Environment_and_Key_Production_Areas"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_16" data-source="" data-orig="Growing Environment and Key Production Areas">Growing Environment and Key Production Areas</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="1208" data-end="1613">オオアザミは日当たりを好みます, 温暖な気候で寒さにも強い, 干ばつ, そして熱. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="It thrives even under summer temperatures reaching 39°C">It thrives even under summer temperatures reaching 39°C</span>. 種子は発芽率が高い (その上 95%) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="in 18–25°C environments and can self-sow easily">in 18–25°C environments and can self-sow easily</span> (王, 2021). さまざまな土壌タイプに耐性を持ちながら、, 作物はルースで最もよく機能します, 水はけの良い砂質ローム. 浸水土壌や塩分土壌には不向きです.</p><p class="" data-start="1615" data-end="2097"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="China’s core production areas are in the northeast">China’s core production areas are in the northeast</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="Panjin in Liaoning and several counties in Heilongjiang">Panjin in Liaoning and several counties in Heilongjiang</span>, ソヌなど, シュンケ, 寧江, そして嘉陰, ～について共同で貢献する 70% 全国総生産量の. 二次地域には尖三江が含まれる, 牡丹江, 翠華, 大興安嶺 (heilongjiang); どれ (ジリン); やけし (内モンゴル); 平涼 (甘粛省); <span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="and parts of Shaanxi province such as Lintong and Weinan">and parts of Shaanxi province such as Lintong and Weinan</span> (CCCMHPIE, 2020). 以下は地域の生産高の概要です。:</p><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="2099" data-end="2622"><thead data-start="2099" data-end="2229"><tr data-start="2099" data-end="2229"><th data-start="2099" data-end="2117" data-col-size="sm">実稼働層</th><th data-start="2117" data-end="2213" data-col-size="md">主要分野</th><th data-start="2213" data-end="2229" data-col-size="sm">出力シェア</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2362" data-end="2622"><tr data-start="2362" data-end="2492"><td data-start="2362" data-end="2381" data-col-size="sm">コア</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2381" data-end="2476">盤錦 (liaoning); ソヌ, シュンケ, 寧江, 嘉陰 (heilongjiang)</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2476" data-end="2492">~70%</td></tr><tr data-start="2493" data-end="2622"><td data-start="2493" data-end="2512" data-col-size="sm">二次</td><td data-col-size="md" data-start="2512" data-end="2606">剣三江, 牡丹江, 翠華, 大興安嶺, どれ, やけし, 平涼, 臨潼, 渭南市</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2606" data-end="2622">~30%</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><h2 class="" data-start="2624" data-end="2674"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Price_Fluctuations_and_Market_Trend_2023%E2%80%932024"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Price Fluctuations and Market Trend">Price Fluctuations and Market Trend</span> (2023–2024年)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="2676" data-end="3042"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Milk thistle seed prices have shown major volatility over the past two decades">Milk thistle seed prices have shown major volatility over the past two decades</span>. で 2003, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="strong demand drove the price up to a historic high of around RMB 30/kg">strong demand drove the price up to a historic high of around RMB 30/kg</span>. しかし, 供給過剰がすぐに続いた, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="pushing prices down to RMB 5.5/kg by 2004–2005 and discouraging farmers from continuing cultivation">pushing prices down to RMB 5.5/kg by 2004–2005 and discouraging farmers from continuing cultivation</span> (CCCMHPIE, 2020). その後、価格は1kgあたり8〜13人民元あたりで安定しました。 2008.</p><p class="" data-start="3044" data-end="3519">で 2020, 市場では需要が再燃し、供給が逼迫した. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Procurement prices rose sharply from RMB 8,067/ton in">Procurement prices rose sharply from RMB 8,067/ton in</span> 2020 11,550.76人民元/トンインチまで 2021, を表す 43.2% 増加 (内モンゴル HHSY バイオテクノロジー株式会社, 2022). この傾向は 2023 年から 2024 年まで続きました, 原材料の入手可能性が限られており、オオアザミから抽出される肝臓保護化合物であるシリマリンに対する国際的な需要が高まっているため、原産地に基づいたサプライヤーからの直接調達への関心が継続的に高まっています。.</p><hr class="" data-start="3521" data-end="3524" /><h2 class="" data-start="3526" data-end="3589"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Why_Choose_Us_Direct_Sourcing_from_the_Main_Production_Area"></span>私たちを選ぶ理由: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area">Direct Sourcing from the Main Production Area</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="3591" data-end="3753">当社は盤錦市に拠点を置いています, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="Liaoning—China’s core production zone for milk thistle seeds">Liaoning—China’s core production zone for milk thistle seeds</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="By working directly with local growers and processors">By working directly with local growers and processors</span>, 私たちは保証します:</p><ul data-start="3755" data-end="3929"><li class="" data-start="3755" data-end="3790"><p class="" data-start="3757" data-end="3790">検証済み農場からの安定供給</p></li><li class="" data-start="3791" data-end="3830"><p class="" data-start="3793" data-end="3830">仲介業者を通さない競争力のある価格設定</p></li><li class="" data-start="3831" data-end="3885"><p class="" data-start="3833" data-end="3885"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="Freshly harvested seeds for maximum extraction yield">Freshly harvested seeds for maximum extraction yield</span></p></li><li class="" data-start="3886" data-end="3929"><p class="" data-start="3888" data-end="3929">完全なドキュメントとエクスポートのサポート</p></li></ul><p class="" data-start="3931" data-end="4084">製薬会社であっても, サプリメントブランド, またはバルクディストリビューター, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="sourcing from us means partnering with a reliable supplier at the source">sourcing from us means partnering with a reliable supplier at the source</span>.</p><hr class="" data-start="4086" data-end="4089" /><h3 data-start="5536" data-end="5584"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Explore_Bulk_Milk_Thistle_Products_%E2%86%92"></span><a href="/ja/milk-thistle-seed-bulk-north-china-production/">オオアザミのバルク製品を詳しく見る →</a><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><h2 class="" data-start="4091" data-end="4116"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References_APA_Style"></span>参考文献 (アパスタイル)<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul data-start="4118" data-end="4825"><li class="" data-start="4118" data-end="4240"><p class="" data-start="4120" data-end="4240">曹操, J., 李, H., &amp; 周, W. (2023). <em data-start="4156" data-end="4216"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="Development of medicinal plant industry in northeast China">Development of medicinal plant industry in northeast China</span></em>. 盤錦研究出版局.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4242" data-end="4385"><p class="" data-start="4244" data-end="4385">CCCMHPIE. (2020). <em data-start="4262" data-end="4306">オオアザミの栽培と輸出の動向</em>. 中国輸入商工会議所 &amp; 医薬品の輸出 &amp; 健康製品.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4387" data-end="4518"><p class="" data-start="4389" data-end="4518">内モンゴル HHSY バイオテクノロジー株式会社, 株式会社. (2022). <span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="Annual report on milk thistle raw material market trends">Annual report on milk thistle raw material market trends</span>. [コーポレートレポート].</p></li><li class="" data-start="4520" data-end="4666"><p class="" data-start="4522" data-end="4666">太陽, F., 張, L., &amp; 王, Y. (2022). <em data-start="4561" data-end="4620"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Ethnobotany of silymarin plants and their historical uses">Ethnobotany of silymarin plants and their historical uses</span></em>. 薬用植物学ジャーナル, 38(4), 210–218.</p></li><li class="" data-start="4668" data-end="4825"><p class="" data-start="4670" data-end="4825">王, T. (2021). <em data-start="4687" data-end="4773"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Milk thistle ecological adaptability and its regional planting distribution in China">Milk thistle ecological adaptability and its regional planting distribution in China</span></em>. 中国の農業科学, 20(12), 1887–1893年.</p></li></ul>`} />
